{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1553332-gadget-ideas-nouveau","id":1553332,"title":"Gadget Ideas Nouveau","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-08-21T11:46:14-07:00","id":1553332,"title":"Gadget Ideas Nouveau","content":"Hello all; recently come back into the Demon fold again, and have been reminded of what fun pondering gadgets is. If you have any on your mind, be sure to post them below;<br /> <br /> <b>Gravity Compass</b><br /> A sleek, segmented yet short wand that had once been a laser pointer. It comes in multiple segments that float rigidly apart from one another in a way that holds together but allows for some flexibility, with a lens that rigidly floats half an inch away from the front of the casing. When clenched in someone's hand its pieces extend just long enough to poke out at both ends.<br /> <b>Exploit:</b> Newton's Nightmares<br /> <b>Trigger and Activation:</b> The user grips the compass strong enough to make it flex slightly, and press gently down on the lens with their thumb.<br /> <b>Effect:</b> When activated and pointed towards a target within 10 yards of the user, the target is suffused with a soft purple light and experiences a brief sensation of weightlessness. The user then points the compass at a desired destination, with the target's personal gravity shifting to have them fall to it. The target can be size 7 at largest, and their personal gravity may shift only up to 90 degrees The target may only move up to 10 yards while under this effect, up to five minutes or until the user activates the compass again, whichever comes sooner, and may suffer falling damage from this. If the target is directed at another person, the victim must make a Wits + Athletics roll to dodge or catch the target, otherwise any victims (and living targets) will suffer (3-Successes) lethal damage.<br /> <br /> If the target is moving or unwilling the user will need to use a Dexterity + Science vs Dexterity + Athletics roll to target them. If the user dramatically fails this roll, they will unknowingly have put their thumb over the beam, putting themselves under the gadget's effects and thus be flung in a random direction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-08-22T01:27:59-07:00","id":1553367,"title":"","content":"This is a gadget I rather like, and an idea I've had before, but I've yet to find if I've posted it here before so apologies if I have repeated myself.<br /> <br /> <b>The Dissonance Fork</b><br /> A vanta black tuning fork that is subtly disquieting to hold. Turning the tuning fork causes it to seemingly turn into a blivet, the seeming flatness giving way to three impossible points, yet two are only ever to be felt.<br /> <b>Exploit:</b> Two Places At Once<br /> <b>Trigger and Activation:</b> The user strikes the fork against a solid object while within an enclosed room, no larger than a small house.<br /> <b>Effect:</b> The fork vibrates and the air within the room vibrates in turn, causing a great deal of dissonance to anyone within it. Though Unchained are unaffected, normal humans and other supernaturals with Wits 3 or lower take a -5 penalty to any actions requiring focus or coordination; any with Wits 4 and above only take a -3 penalty. Though they appear to be vibrating, solid objects are not harmed by the fork's direct influence - liquids, however, are shaken violently in their containers and may cause them to fall over in turn.<br /> <br /> The effect continues until the fork stops vibrating on its own accord, is immersed completely in liquid, leaves the space of the room or a full minute has passed. Anyone susceptible to it is left stunned for a few seconds (one round action time) before they are able to act.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}